      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm experiencing this as well! I do have a lot of continuous sync. Been troubleshooting several times a day to figure it out and driving myself crazy. Performance is fine for about 90 seconds, and then FPS dives from in the 70's to the teens. The world in question is still private, happy to have people take a look.\n\nIf there's a recommended maximum number of Udon scripts running continuous I'd love to know. In this world, object pickups are fundamental to the premise.",
