      "value": "@{62cea1224517083b068f949b|full_name}: I think FPS drop seems to be better, but networking is not: syncing of ObjectSync owned by Master can be degraded, making too laggy on other player's client.\n\nThis seems to be happened on old worlds that contains many Continuous (without ObjectSync) sync.\n\nSome worlds can be reproduced:\n\n# World A\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_c4ab8457-f538-45b0-871a-9838be4a3342\n\n- The dices rolled by Master is really laggy on other player's client.\n\n# World B\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_47c60092-5db3-4a61-9c30-f5777ce76baf\n\n- The cards handled by Master is really laggy on other player's client.\n\n- Tile Randomizer (by pushing `Panel Set` button) is broken on other player's client.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
